  "title": "Springerle V",
  "description": "This is the best tasting, easiest prepared springerle recipe I have baked over the past 35+ years. I use a springerle board for ease, vs. the rolling pin. My friends still love to receive these as gifts each Christmas.",
  "authors": [
    "Shirley"
